==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Ghost Baa Baa]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Ghost Snache]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
*10 [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*6 [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 14.67 seconds<sup>440f</sup>, delay 3.33~13.33 seconds<sup>100f~400f</sup>.
*7 [[Ghost Snache]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 3.33~10 seconds<sup>100f~300f</sup>.
*3 [[Sir Seal]]s spawn after 32 seconds<sup>960f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*1 [[Shy Boy]] spawns after 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that most units can beat. Bring [[Fish Cat (Normal Cat)|Whale Cat]] and [[Axe Cat (Normal Cat)|Brave Cat]] to win.

